Hiya Nethackers !

First I'd like to thank the developers of NETHACK very much for their
work. Nethack is one of the best games I've ever played. I succeeded
to port Nethack to my OS-9 Machine (OS-9/68k) and I have applied all
the patches as soon as they arrived. I have found no serious bugs,
but I have some problems with the new feature that allows to use
smaller screens (e.g. 40 characters per line). In this mode, the
dungeon is mixed up in some places. Has anyone experienced this ?
By the way, does anyone have some information about the history of
nethack ? I think its based on hack and hack is based on rogue,
but I'm not sure at all and I'd appreciate information on that.

Very Best Greetings,
Frank (Nethackomaniac)

